{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“远处的旧歌”由“像”引出，是比喻而非他真实经历过的往事；亲近仍在却不能恢复过去，承接了 S01 已确立的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"在意未散、重新亲近不能让过去复原，均有 S01 支撑；认真承认自己仍然珍惜，是对既有在意的进一步表达，没有新增具体人物关系或事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"挺直、庄严和一点骄傲表现的是他面对在意时的姿态变化，与本段要确立的庄重承受相符；没有把比喻写成真实场景或新增外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不再等待在意自行散去，承接了 S01 中在意并未散去、开始想认真面对它的变化；克制与姿态稳定也符合本段的新变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 5,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"挺直变得费力、一遍遍催自己撑住，具体推进了从庄重承受到需要反复用力维持的变化；激动渐急、末尾悬着是情绪化表达，没有声称音乐变化导致了他的心理变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 6,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"克制不能使过去复原、牵挂仍未消散，均承接前文；反复绷紧会耗费力气，是对维持姿态所需代价的合理延伸，没有新增前史、具体关系或外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"本段接续 S01 中亲近不能让过去复原、在意却未散去的变化，进一步推进到以庄重和克制承受在意，并察觉这种姿态需要反复用力维持，而非只重复全曲一直成立的背景理由。\",\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"六条形成了从熟悉却无法恢复过去，到承认在意、借助克制站稳，再到发现维持姿态需要耗费力气的清晰递进；即使不看听感记录，也能理解其情绪发展。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "515d79cc-5559-4622-b8a9-f748828ffcd0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T231558192802Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.735, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:17:04.943399+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "93cf28ae5a452e15a30aa8768bffa07d845767379df8e6c7a5a7f71c4ad75fa4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T231558192802Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "736321665c8deee828cab8076973f7b7b7badcd8647924fd230b955ed5bb717c"}}}
